{
  "baseline": "d09bd677a",
  "change": "The preview retains at most three decoded static floor backgrounds. When the displayed floor changes one idle worker may decode the next regular floor artwork. The caller selects only the actual current or explicitly pinned graph and its matching artwork. No model or inference changes. Approximate maximum cache payload is 17.14 MiB; other live images and decoder scratch are additional.",
  "method": "Warm 2052x1128 local Windows game-image replay with a second Windows Graphics Capture session observing the owned assistant window only. Clock starts before the replay changes its pixels. Endpoint requires two newly recognized visible interactive inventory tiles at distinct positions or the correct changed floor (zone_2 to zone_3, template 3j), matching pixels against the actual diagram. All pre-switch frames are negative. Per-process isolation; alternated baseline/candidate ordering. WGC arrival includes delivery latency; no physical scan-out measurement or running game.",
